From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:17:07 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 85/93] flashnext cuda: --pp 2 serves the prompt cache, each
 stage keeping its own layers' states

Snapshots size, save and restore a pipeline stage's own linear and attention layers (cuda_snap.stageBytes), and rank 0
drives rank 1's copy over the existing save/restore/drop frames, so --prompt-cache-gib under --pp 2 follows the same
rule as one rank or --tp 2. --spill-gib and --learn-conversations stay refused under --pp.
---
